     "text": "Philips received a complaint regarding IntelliSpace Cardiovascular (ISCV), indicating that whenever previous findings are carried forward, the indication from the prior order is also carried forward and replaces the indication associated with the current order, resulting in inaccurate display of the current order information.Philips has started an investigation of this complaint."
